 "description": "The chassis reaction_moment at the motor clamps must balance the stall torque of both 75:1 gearmotors, 2 x 0.108 N*m = 0.216 N*m (as the balance loop's torque_peak still says). It is written as 0.108 N*m, the torque of one gearmotor, so the moment the chassis carries is half the moment the two motors put on it and the clamp statics do not balance.",
